        <p style="font-family:var(--sans);font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-muted);margin-bottom:var(--s-4);">A custom tanzanite cuff, designed as an unexpected way to decorate the ear: a color of violet hues and a finish that are one of a kind.</p>
