<!-- THE PROCESS -->
<section class="process-section section-divider">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="process-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">How it works</span>
      <h2 class="h2">The custom process, in four steps.</h2>
      <p class="lede" style="max-width:52ch;margin:0 auto;">Every commission begins with a conversation and ends with something made only for you.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="process-steps reveal-stagger">
      <div class="process-step">
        <div class="num">01</div>
        <h4>Sourcing</h4>
        <p>Each jewel begins with the search for a stone — chosen for its beauty, energy, and timeless essence. With access to New York's Diamond District and a network of trusted gemologists, I source diamonds, fancy colored diamonds, and gemstones that reflect both your vision and the highest standards of authenticity.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="process-step">
        <div class="num">02</div>
        <h4>Sketch &amp; Design</h4>
        <p>We begin with inspiration — mood boards, rough sketches, and conversation — shaping ideas into clear directions. I present thoughtful options and refine proportions, forms, and stones until everything feels just right.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="process-step">
        <div class="num">03</div>
        <h4>Creation</h4>
        <p>Once the design is finalized, it moves into the hands of master jewelers. I collaborate with trusted 5th Avenue manufacturers who bring precision and artistry to every detail. Clients review and approve detailed CAD renderings before production begins.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="process-step">
        <div class="num">04</div>
        <h4>The Final Piece</h4>
        <p>When your piece is complete, it's carefully polished, inspected, and prepared for its journey. Whether we meet in person or I ship securely to you anywhere in the world, every detail is handled with care.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CTA -->
<section style="background:var(--ink);color:var(--cream);padding:var(--s-14) var(--gutter);text-align:center;">
  <span class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--bronze);margin-bottom:var(--s-5);display:block;">Something made only for you</span>
  <h2 class="h2" style="color:var(--cream);margin-bottom:var(--s-7);">Custom commissions are open.<br>Every collaboration begins with a <span class="italic">conversation.</span></h2>
  <a href="{{ routes.contact_url }}" class="btn btn-frame" style="border-color:rgba(245,240,232,0.6);color:var(--cream);">Let's create together</a>
</section>

